    "mid": {
      "text": "Hey, um, thanks for having me. So basically what we do is, we, our product kind of helps our customers with a problem that they all have, which is that the way they handle it right now is really inefficient and it takes them a lot of time, and there time is expensive. Um, so we built a thing that, like, does most of it for them automatically, and people seem to really like it. We launched it last year and, uh, we have grew a lot since then, like a lot, and our margin is pretty good too, because it's mostly software. Our customers mostly found us on their own, which I think is a good sign, and there's less steps for them now than before. Retention is, honestly, it's okay. It's something we're working on. I started this because I ran into the problem myself and nobody had built anything decent for it, so I taught myself to code. Uh, we're a small team, it's me and two other people, and we all do a bit of everything. So yeah, that's kind of the idea. We're looking for some funding to grow faster and hire and do marketing and stuff. So, yeah. Thanks.",
